    "title": "Darby Borough kids were treated to haircuts and braids to look good for starting school - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Editorials ,\n12 hours ago As the first days of school approached, dozens of school children lined up for free haircuts, braids, and fresh styles courtesy of the Hair Ministry & Co. Salon in Darby Borough on Aug. 28. The eight-hour “Back-to-School Hair and Style Day,” sponsored by the Darby Borough Police Department, also treated kids to complimentary school supplies, pizza, hoagies, soft pretzels, and gift bags. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak 14",
